for(const answer of results){for(const key of ['id','skill','conclusion','actions','evidence','unresolved'])if(!(key in answer))throw new Error(`Missing ${key}`);for(const evidence of answer.evidence)if(!fs.existsSync(evidence))throw new Error(`Missing evidence: ${evidence}`);}
save('output/answers.json',{answers:results});
save('output/structural-check.json',{caseCount:results.length,ids:results.map(a=>a.id),requiredFieldsPresent:true,evidenceFilesExist:true,catalogEmpty:true,gradingPerformed:false});
console.log(JSON.stringify({written:'output/answers.json',caseCount:results.length,structuralCheck:'output/structural-check.json'},null,2));
